⏺ Three DAGs in order. They're already scheduled, but to refresh on demand trigger them manually:

  ┌───────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────┐
  │      DAG      │                                    What it does                                     │            Schedule            │
  ├───────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┤
  │ daily_prices  │ Pulls last ~7 days of OHLCV from yfinance for the full Nifty 500, idempotent upsert │ 0 13 * * 1-5 (after NSE close) │
  ├───────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┤
  │ daily_navs    │ Pulls latest NAVs from mfapi.in for the 30 curated schemes                          │ 30 14 * * *                    │
  ├───────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┤
  │ feature_build │ Recomputes *_features + *_recommendations from refreshed prices/NAVs                │ 0 16 * * *                     │
  └───────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────┘

  To trigger now from the UI: http://localhost:8080 → DAGs → click each → ▶ "Trigger DAG". Run daily_prices and daily_navs first (they're independent, can run in parallel), then feature_build once both
  finish.

  Or from the CLI:
  docker compose exec airflow-scheduler airflow dags trigger daily_prices
  docker compose exec airflow-scheduler airflow dags trigger daily_navs
  # wait until both succeed
  docker compose exec airflow-scheduler airflow dags trigger feature_build


